; letter-spacing: 2px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(127, 134, 249) 30.8%, rgb(191, 158, 245) 97.6%); color: transparent; background-clip: text; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">加盟风控 源头治理</span></strong></p></section><section style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"background-color: rgb(193, 173, 242); height: 1px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float: left; line-height: 0; width: 0px; vertical-align: top; visibility: visible;\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"插图\"></svg></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify; font-size: 14px; line-height: 2; letter-spacing: 1.8px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">为进一步赋能团队客户加盟业务合规，防范招商加盟法律风险。2026年4月22日，博望餐饮法务团队四月法务课如期开展。主题为</span><span style=\"color: rgb(114, 74, 216); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">“加盟风控 源头治理——招商加盟风险合规指引”</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">。本次分享由盈科沈阳合伙人、博望团队合伙人</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">党俏律师<span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: normal; visibility: visible;\">与</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">团队</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">浦宝婧律师</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">担任主讲人，线上线下同步联动，五十余名博望客户齐聚一堂，共学合规知识、共筑风控防线。主持人为博望团队</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">冯诗涵律师</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\"><br style=\"visibility: visible;\"></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\"><br style=\"visibility: visible;\"></span></p><section style=\"text-align: center; justify-content: center; display: flex; flex-flow: row; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; width: 92%; vertical-align: top; align-self: flex-start; flex: 0 0 auto; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); height: auto; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgba(171, 157, 255, 0.37); box-shadow: rgb(237, 231, 255) 0px 3px 2px 0px; padding: 18px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: 0; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%; vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; line-height: 0; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.6666666666666666\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/KAOThu2SXBz8ibeU5MqLSn6DWnibRlOicVyTrtOA9u04GTy2AoJQC81eBenBRFfavurI0picLUjemu0icgCwW7D9VLmQmYTVjfDPkyoAdwib0BVXo/640?wx_fmt=jpeg#imgIndex=2\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; width: 584.828px !important; box-sizing: border-box; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"5\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/KAOThu2SXBz8ibeU5MqLSn6DWnibRlOicVyTrtOA9u04GTy2AoJQC81eBenBRFfavurI0picLUjemu0icgCwW7D9VLmQmYTVjfDPkyoAdwib0BVXo/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=2\" _width=\"100%\" alt=\"图片\" data-report-img-idx=\"2\" data-fail=\"0\"></section></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p></section><section style=\"margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 14px;line-height: 2;letter-spacing: 1.8px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\">加盟业务涉及多方主体与复杂法律关系，合同签署、条款解读、纠纷处理等每一个环节都暗藏风险，稍有疏忽便可能引发纠纷。此次分享两位律师结合自身丰富的实务经验，用案例拆解、要点提炼的方式，为大家带来了一堂干货满满的分享课。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p></section><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 100%;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: auto;align-self: center;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;padding: 2px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(101, 117, 254);letter-spacing: 1px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">加盟合同重点条款解读</span></strong></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: auto;align-self: center;flex: 0 0 auto;background-image: linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(238, 41, 255, 0.14) 13%, rgba(43, 183, 255, 0.13) 88%);min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;padding: 3px 5px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 10px;color: rgb(114, 74, 216);letter-spacing: 0.6px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">BOWANG</span></p></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 3px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(165, 186, 255) 13%, rgb(225, 216, 247) 88%);height: 1px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"插图\"></svg></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 14px;line-height: 2;letter-spacing: 1.8px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\">党俏律师以“案例+解读”的形式，将工作中经手的加盟纠纷案例与法律条款深度结合，重点讲解了加盟业务核心风险点以及加盟合同的关键条款解读。党律师结合《商业特许经营管理条例》相关规定，详细拆解了合同签署中需重点关注的细节，同时针对合同解除中的高频问题给出了应对建议，帮助大家在面对合同解除时“有法可依、有章可循”。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 20px 0px 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_img_placeholder wx_img_placeholder\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.6666666666666666\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/KAOThu2SXBwnNa62yppZXIDicAfxbmrkUFaH8ILCxgfn8dtwzq7yAPHC5HSgzuTiaiaYalySADCoibnXAMHVhUmcf1r4nbdqaibwz82ia2T3DiaJKg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg#imgIndex=3\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; aspect-ratio: calc(1.5) / 1; width: 585px !important; height: auto !important;\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"6\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3C%3Fxml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'%3F%3E%3Csvg width='1px' height='1px' viewBox='0 0 1 1' version='1.1' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink'%3E%3Ctitle%3E%3C/title%3E%3Cg stroke='none' stroke-width='1' fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd' fill-opacity='0'%3E%3Cg transform='translate(-249.000000, -126.000000)' fill='%23FFFFFF'%3E%3Crect x='249' y='126' width='1' height='1'%3E%3C/rect%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E\" _width=\"100%\" alt=\"图片\"></section></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p></section><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 100%;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: auto;align-self: center;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;padding: 2px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(101, 117, 254);letter-spacing: 1px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">加盟合同签署及履行</span></strong></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: auto;align-self: center;flex: 0 0 auto;background-image: linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(238, 41, 255, 0.14) 13%, rgba(43, 183, 255, 0.13) 88%);min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;padding: 3px 5px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 10px;color: rgb(114, 74, 216);letter-spacing: 0.6px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">BOWANG</span></p></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 3px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(165, 186, 255) 13%, rgb(225, 216, 247) 88%);height: 1px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"插图\"></svg></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 14px;line-height: 1.8;letter-spacing: 1.8px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\">浦宝婧律师聚焦加盟合同签署及履行实务，讲解了加盟合同及相关文件签署时的注意事项以及合同履行的常见处理方式。从合同签署的前置核查、条款审核到履行过程中的履约监管、争议应对，层层拆解、重点剖析。浦律师提醒大家签署加盟合同警惕模糊条款、不平等约定，避免留下合规隐患。浦律师诣在帮助品牌精准掌握合同履行风险防控，有效规避因不规范引发的法律纠纷，切实保障加盟业务双方的合法权益。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 20px 0px 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_img_placeholder wx_img_placeholder\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.6666666666666666\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/KAOThu2SXByMnNqXzh5d1tXchTDg5FJ0DC7FiacAGnILp1CqmICx92DPhbOWaFAZsa81iam4o3icm0dtx0VicMTAt4lWEDcMbSiah4LoGN89HwqE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg#imgIndex=4\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; aspect-ratio: calc(1.5) / 1; width: 585px !important; height: auto !important;\" data-or